Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:03.80,HookGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Wolof TechStein beat wê!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.20,0:00:13.60,IntroSerif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Non vivi o - o nvi gboon\Nmavomavo.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.00,0:00:17.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Hwenu e mon non ji gbonton o\Nji
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.00,0:00:23.90,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Before the world could call\Nmy name
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.90,0:00:27.90,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Le jour où tu m'as tenu dans\Ntes bras
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.90,0:00:31.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}You already knew my soul
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.00,0:00:35.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Azoon lon bo - wo a toln kpo
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.00,0:00:37.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Every storm, you stood in\Nthe rain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.00,0:00:41.90,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Toutes les nuits - tu as\Nveillé
Dialogue: 0,0:00:41.90,0:00:45.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}So I could stay warm, so I\Ncould remain
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.00,0:00:48.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Non vivi o - a non da nu mi
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.00,0:00:52.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ton amour - tu me l'as donné
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.00,0:00:54.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}No words can hold what you\Ngave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.00,0:00:58.00,VerseMono,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}A love too wide, too deep\Nfor the grave
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.00,0:01:02.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - you are my one
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.00,0:01:05.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - my only sun
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.00,0:01:08.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Gboon ce o - tu es ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.00,0:01:12.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ma mère unique - forever\Nwith me
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.00,0:01:16.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Even if the sky forgets my\Nname
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.00,0:01:20.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Even if I'm lost, you guide\Nmy way
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.00,0:01:26.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - mi non no fi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.00,0:01:30.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}I hear you say - I'm here,\NI'll stay
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.00,0:01:34.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Hwenu e a yi - nyi ma se o
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.00,0:01:37.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}The silence you left was a\Nkind of sound
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.00,0:01:41.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Le jour où tu es partie - je\Nn'entendais pas
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.00,0:01:44.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Like a bell that rings with\Nno one around
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.00,0:01:47.80,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Non e a do mi - o non no nyi\Nmon
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.80,0:01:51.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}In every choice, in every\Nstep I take
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.00,0:01:55.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ce que tu m'as laissé - vit\Nencore en moi
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.00,0:01:58.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}I carry your heart - it will\Nnever break
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.00,0:02:02.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Non vivi o - o ku kpoonon
Dialogue: 0,0:02:02.00,0:02:05.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ton amour - il ne meurt\Njamais
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.00,0:02:08.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Death could not take what\Nyou gave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.00,0:02:11.00,VerseSans,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}A flame still burning beyond\Nthe grave
Dialogue: 0,0:02:11.00,0:02:15.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - you are my one
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.00,0:02:18.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - my only sun
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.00,0:02:22.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Gboon ce o - tu es ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.00,0:02:25.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ma mère unique - forever\Nwith me
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.00,0:02:29.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Even if the sky forgets my\Nname
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.00,0:02:33.80,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Even if I'm lost, you guide\Nmy way
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.80,0:02:40.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - mi non no fi
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.00,0:02:42.00,RefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}I hear you say - I'm here,\NI'll stay
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.00,0:02:44.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.00,0:02:47.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}A non no nyi sisi mon.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.00,0:02:50.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Tu vis dans mon souffle.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.00,0:02:54.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}You never left.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.00,0:03:01.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mon e nyi non - o nyi jon\Nmawu.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.00,0:03:05.00,BridgeSerifCenter,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Celle qui est mère - est un\Ndon du ciel.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.00,0:03:09.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}MAMA TCHE - you are my one
Dialogue: 0,0:03:09.00,0:03:12.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}MAMA TCHE - my only sun
Dialogue: 0,0:03:12.00,0:03:15.90,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Gboon ce o - tu es ma vie
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.90,0:03:19.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Ma mère unique - forever\Nwith me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.00,0:03:23.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}A yi - koonon non vivi o no\Nfi
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.00,0:03:30.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Tu es partie - mais l'amour\Nreste ici
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.00,0:03:36.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Every morning your voice\Nstill finds me
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.00,0:03:39.40,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche - eternally
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.40,0:03:44.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Wolof TechStein beat wê!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:44.00,0:03:49.00,FinalRefrainGold,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}Mama tche... Mama tche...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.00,0:03:54.00,OutroSerif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}"Mon e nyi non - o nyi gboon\Nmavomavo."
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.00,0:04:00.00,OutroSerif,,0,0,0,,{\fad(140,140)}"Celle qui est mère - est\Nlumière pour toujours."
